      "html": "<p>This colour morph of the Bronze corydoras exhibits a lot of orange colours. It belongs to the “Gold Shoulder” group, which is sometimes named Corydoras schultzei; however, this name is currently considered to be a synonym of C. aeneus. The fish is very rare and available in limited numbers only.</p>"
